    "raw": "\\*Data estimated. \nPhase changes: 368.3 K, orthorhombic - monoclinic transition point of S; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 0.096$ kcal/mol. \n388.36 K, melting point of S; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 0.413$ kcal/mol. \n395 K, α - β transition point of Pu; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 0.820$ kcal/mol. \n432.02 K, second order transformation of S; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 0$ kcal/mol. \n480 K, β - γ transition point of Pu; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 0.135$ kcal/mol. \n588 K, γ - δ transition point of Pu; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 0.140$ kcal/mol. \n717.824 K, boiling point of S to equilibrium mixture of $S_{n}$ (n = 1 to 8). \nHeat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations: \n298.15-1500 K: $Cp^{\\circ} = 15.258 + 1.990 \\times 10^{-3} T - 0.454 \\times 10^{5} T^{-2}$ \n$H^{\\circ}-H_{298}^{\\circ}=15.258\\times10^{-3}T+0.995\\times10^{-6}T^{2}+0.454\\times10^{2}T^{-1}=4.790$ \nFormation equations (kcal/mol): \n<table><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">298.15-368.3 K:</td><td> $\\Delta Hf^{\\circ} = -116.815 - 0.993x10^{-3}T - 2.903x10^{-6}T^{2} - 188.000T^{-1}$ </td></tr><tr><td> $\\Delta Gf^{\\circ} = -116.815 + 0.993x10^{-3}T\\ln T + 2.903x10^{-6}T^{2} - 94.000T^{-1} - 7.028x10^{-3}T$ </td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">368.3-388.36 K:</td><td> $\\Delta Hf^{\\circ} = -118.488 + 2.401x10^{-3}T - 5.523x10^{-6}T^{2} + 45.400T^{-1}$ </td></tr><tr><td> $\\Delta Gf^{\\circ} = -118.488 - 2.401x10^{-3}T\\ln T + 5.523x10^{-6}T^{2} + 22.700T^{-1} + 15.746x10^{-3}T$ </td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">388.36-395 K:</td><td> $\\Delta Hf^{\\circ} = -142.725 + 69.512x10^{-3}T - 70.446x10^{-6}T^{2} + 2898.700T^{-1}$ </td></tr><tr><td> $\\Delta Gf^{\\circ} = -142.725 - 69.512x10^{-3}T\\ln T + 70.446x10^{-6}T^{2} + 1449.350T^{-1} + 443.589x10^{-3}T$ </td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">395-432.02 K:</td><td> $\\Delta Hf^{\\circ} = -143.336 + 67.444x10^{-3}T - 66.555x10^{-6}T^{2} + 2898.700T^{-1}$ </td></tr><tr><td> $\\Delta Gf^{\\circ} = -143.336 - 67.444x10^{-3}T\\ln T + 66.555x10^{-6}T^{2} + 1449.350T^{-1} + 434.313x10^{-3}T$ </td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">432.02-480 K:</td><td> $\\Delta Hf^{\\circ} = -157.554 + 61.586x10^{-3}T - 36.838x10^{-6}T^{2} + 7738.450T^{-1}$ </td></tr><tr><td> $\\Delta Gf^{\\circ} = -157.554 - 61.586x10^{-3}T\\ln T + 36.838x10^{-6}T^{2} + 3869.225T^{-1} + 431.541x10^{-3}T$ </td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">480-588 K:</td><td> $\\Delta Hf^{\\circ} = -157.950 + 62.541x10^{-3}T - 37.696x10^{-6}T^{2} + 7738.450T^{-1}$ </td></tr><tr><td> $\\Delta Gf^{\\circ} = -157.950 - 62.541x10^{-3}T\\ln T + 37.696x10^{-6}T^{2} + 3869.225T^{-1} + 437.850x10^{-3}T$ </td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">588-717.824 K:</td><td> $\\Delta Hf^{\\circ} = -157.060 + 58.766x10^{-3}T - 34.254x10^{-6}T^{2} + 7738.450T^{-1}$ </td></tr><tr><td> $\\Delta Gf^{\\circ} = -157.060 - 58.766x10^{-3}T\\ln T + 34.254x10^{-6}T^{2} + 3869.225T^{-1} + 414.289x10^{-3}T$ </td></tr></table>",
